{"element":{"id":558,"data":{"type":"EssentialElements\\FrequentlyAskedQuestions","properties":{"content":{"settings":{"questions":[{"question":"Is this a lifetime license?","answer":"<p>Yes. You can use it on an unlimited number of sites. There are no limits.</p><ul><li><p>Lorem ipsum sit dolor amet</p></li><li><p>Lorem ipsum sit dolor amet</p></li></ul><p></p>"},{"question":"Where can in edit my address?","answer":"<p>If you created a new account after or while ordering you can edit both addresses (for billing and shipping) in your&nbsp;<a href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">customer account</a>.<br></p>","button":null},{"answer":"<p>Unfortunately, we’re unable to offer free samples. As a retailer, we buy all magazines from their publishers at the regular trade price. However, you could contact the magazine’s publisher directly to ask if they can send you a free copy.</p>","question":"Can I order a free copy of a magazine to sample?","button":{"text":"Click Here"}}],"accordion":false,"first_tab_open":false,"first_tab_opened":true,"items":[{"answer":"<p class=\"\" data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"463\">Every call is intercepted before the phone rings. If the number is recognised as safe, it goes through. If not, our AI assistant Maya answers on your behalf and decides what happens next.</p>","question":"How does Everguard actually block scam calls?"},{"answer":"<p class=\"\" data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"744\">Yes. You can add trusted numbers during setup, and Maya is trained to recognise medical and professional callers. If she’s unsure, we’ll alert you — and the phone won’t ring until you’ve reviewed it.</p>","question":"Will my loved one still get important calls, like from their doctor?"},{"answer":"<p class=\"\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"960\">Not at all. The phone arrives fully set up. They just plug it in and pick up when it rings. Everything else is handled through your app or dashboard.</p>","question":"Does the person I’m protecting need to be tech-savvy?","button":null},{"answer":"<p class=\"\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1161\">You’ll get a summary of all screened calls. If something important was held back, just tap to approve it — and it won’t be blocked again.</p>","question":"What if someone important gets blocked by mistake?","button":null},{"question":"Is there an app for caregivers?","answer":"<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1361\">Yes. The app lets you add contacts, review call history, and get alerts. You can also temporarily pause screening if you know a new number will be calling.</p>"},{"question":"Can we try it before committing?","answer":"<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1686\">Yes. We offer a free trial period so you can see the protection in action. No strings attached — just peace of mind.</p>"}]}},"design":{"main_container":{"borders":{"border":null},"max_width":{"number":650,"unit":"px","style":"650px"}},"item_containers":{"spacing":{"padding":null},"borders":null},"icon":{"icon_animation":"rotation","icon":{"slug":"icon-chevron-right.","name":"chevron right","svgCode":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"><!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.1 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --><path d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/></svg>"},"icon_rotation":{"number":90,"unit":"deg","style":"90deg"},"second_icon":{"slug":"icon-times.","name":"times","svgCode":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 352 512\"><!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.1 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: M